PRD: Magnivo Mailer — Cold Outreach & Warmup Engine


1. Summary
Magnivo Mailer is a native email outreach and inbox-warmup module inside the Magnivo AI-native GTM OS. It lets clients connect their own mailboxes (Gmail, Outlook/M365, Zoho, or any SMTP/IMAP provider), automatically warm those mailboxes up to a healthy sending reputation, and run multi-step outreach sequences at scale — functionally equivalent to Instantly.ai, but fed and operated by Magnivo's existing lead-gen and research agents instead of requiring manual campaign setup.
2. Problem statement
Magnivo already generates leads and researches prospects via its agent pipeline, but has no native execution layer for cold email at scale with proper deliverability infrastructure. Clients currently need a separate tool (Instantly, Smartlead, Lemlist, etc.) to actually send sequences, which breaks the "single GTM OS" value proposition and loses the personalization data our agents already generate.
3. Goals
Let a client connect any mailbox (OAuth or SMTP/IMAP) and start warming it up within minutes
Automatically graduate mailboxes from "cold" to "warm" before allowing live campaign sending
Run multi-step, multi-mailbox outreach sequences with pooled sending to keep per-mailbox volume low
Maintain sender reputation and deliverability metrics visible to the client
Feed AI-personalized content per lead using Magnivo's existing research agents, not static templates
4. Non-goals (v1)
Building a full email client / inbox replacement UI (unified inbox is read/reply only, not a full compose-everything mail client)
Supporting mailbox providers beyond Gmail, Outlook/M365, Zoho, and generic SMTP/IMAP
LinkedIn or multi-channel sequencing (email-only for v1; multi-channel is a future phase)
