10. Risks / dependencies
Google/Microsoft OAuth app verification — sensitive-scope review can take weeks; must be initiated before MVP target date
Google/Yahoo bulk sender compliance (Feb 2024 rules, still enforced) — one-click unsubscribe header and sub-0.3% complaint rate are mandatory once volume crosses 5,000/day to Gmail/Yahoo addresses
Shared infra reputation risk — warmup pool and tracking domains must be isolated per tenant/purpose from day one; retrofitting is expensive
Abuse prevention — need per-mailbox/per-account caps to stop one bad actor from damaging shared reputation
